### VS Code REST Client: enter the local base URL and your own temporary user token locally.
### Do not commit tokens, passwords, keys or modified local copies of this file.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@answerId = REPLACE_WITH_CONFIRMED_SAVED_ANSWER_UUID

### Obtain a user access token locally; REST Client reads it from your process environment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluate-answer
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv INTERVIEW_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"answerId":"{{answerId}}"}

### Read stored feedback without Gemini calls.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluate-answer?answerId={{answerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv INTERVIEW_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Error case: malformed UUID must return BAD_INPUT without an AI call.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluate-answer
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv INTERVIEW_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"answerId":"invalid-uuid"}
